      "updated": 1786900000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Weeks with spend but no subscriptions must stay in the mart.\nDropping them hid $2,732.38 -- 7.0% of all marketing spend --\nand understated CAC in both channels. The fix builds the mart\non a spine of every channel-week that appears in EITHER\nsubscriptions or spend.",
